<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 683w" sizes="100vw" width="683" height="455" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/claim-valuation-services/">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Water Damage &amp; Leak Claims</nav><p class="tag">Service</p><h1>Water Damage Claim Appraisal in Rhode Island</h1><p class="lede">Water travels. A complete scope follows it into wall cavities, subfloors and the unit below, not just the stain on the ceiling.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn glass" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Common sources</dt><dd>Pipes, appliances, rain</dd></div><div><dt>Watch for</dt><dd>Hidden damage</dd></div><div><dt>Also</dt><dd>Mold remediation limits</dd></div></dl></div></section><div class="wrap layout"><article class="prose">
<p>Water damage claim appraisal in Rhode Island covers the most common type of interior loss we see. Older plumbing in pre-war homes, washing machine and water heater failures, ice-dam leaks and rain driven through walls during coastal storms all show up regularly. The damage is often bigger than it looks on the day it happens.</p>
<h2>What a water scope should include</h2>
<ul>
<li>Moisture mapping to find where water traveled behind finishes</li>
<li>Emergency services and drying, with equipment counts and days that match the job</li>
<li>Removal and replacement of saturated drywall, plaster, insulation and flooring</li>
<li>Cabinetry and trim that can’t be removed without damage</li>
<li>Painting to a logical break, not just the stained patch</li>
<li>Damage to units below in multi-family buildings</li>
</ul>
<h2>Coverage limits to watch</h2>
<p>Policies treat sudden leaks, long-term seepage, surface water and sewer backup differently, and many cap mold remediation. Backup of sewers and drains usually needs a separate endorsement. These are coverage questions; we flag them and value the covered portion.</p>
<h3>After a freeze</h3>
<p>Burst pipes during a cold snap often combine with ice-dam leaks. Our <a href="/claim-valuation-services/ice-dam-freeze-claims/">ice dam and frozen pipe service</a> covers those winter losses in detail.</p><h2>Questions about water damage &amp; leak claims</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>The carrier only paid for the stained area. Is that normal?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>It’s common in first estimates. Water usually spreads further than visible staining, and paint and finishes need to be matched to a logical break.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is sewer backup covered?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Often only if you bought a water backup endorsement. That’s a coverage question; if it’s covered, appraisal can resolve the cost.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you value mold remediation?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, where it’s part of the covered loss. Many policies cap mold, so we separate it clearly in the estimate.</p></div></details></div><h2>Related services</h2><div class="related"><a href="/claim-valuation-services/ice-dam-freeze-claims/"><small>Service</small><span>Ice Dam, Snow Load &amp; Frozen Pipe Claims</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/claim-valuation-services/fire-smoke-claim-valuation/"><small>Service</small><span>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a href="/claim-valuation-services/claim-estimate-audit/"><small>Service</small><span>Insurance Estimate Review</span><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through</h2><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-t">All services</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/appraisal-clause-advocacy/">Appraisal Clause Representation<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/homeowner-claim-valuation/">Homeowner Claim Valuation<svg class="ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></a></li><li><a href="/claim-valuation-services/commercial-condo-hoa-claims/">Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Claims<svg class="ic" w